[anyone, "cpsq_liberator_5", [], "Gladly. You see, there was a city-state neighbouring the old {s31}; that is where I was born. You probably haven't learnt much of it, since it was captured by the Imperial Legion prior to your birth and had little political power whatsoever. But it was indeed there, and the populace even paid a yearly tribute to your country to ensure you don't attack us. ", "cpsq_liberator_6", [] ],
